# FreeCell self test (text shell, NODESK): "freecell -t" deals games 1 and 65535, prints the
# run limits, checks the rules on made positions, the safe rule, the test position (-w) and
# plays random moves on ten deals, all undone. The output after the command is compared with
# tests/freecell-t.txt.
1500 {esc}
+1500 freecell -t\n
